  "query_preview": "../Monday to Thursday/...The ridging over the eastern \ngulf starts to give way on Sunday along a short wave that moves \nacross the northern gulf and central gulf coast to the Northeast \ngulf coast. Expect to see some light precipitation to spread in \nfollowed by a brief break late Monday to Tuesday and then another \nsystem to move in Wednesday and Thursday. Continuing precip Friday\ninto the start of the weekend with the onshore flow over the \nnorthern portion of the gulf and into the panhandle. \n\nTemperatures continuing to be near normal values for this time of\nthe year. Localized winds along Lynn Canal could lead to some\nbreezy days for Haines and Skagway.",
